OL,3,CMartin and Merz to hold talks in Dublin
OL,5,FThe Taoiseach will later use a meeting
OL,6,Fwith German Chancellor Friedrich Merz
OL,7,Fto express Ireland's solidarity with
OL,8,Fthe victims of the weekend attack on
OL,9,Fthe Berlin Pride festival.
OL,11,FMr Merz will hold talks with Micheal
OL,12,FMartin on a visit to Dublin on Tuesday.
OL,14,FThe meeting comes during Ireland's six-
OL,15,Fmonth presidency of the EU Council.
OL,26,@sD@crp
