OL,3,CMartin and Merz to hold talks in Dublin
OL,5,FMr Martin said the engagement would
OL,6,Ffocus on "some of the biggest
OL,7,Fchallenges" facing the bloc, including
OL,8,Fthe ongoing wrangle between member
OL,9,Fstates on the size of the EU's long-
OL,10,Fterm budget.
OL,12,FGermany is one of a number of nations
OL,13,Fpressing for a smaller settlement than
OL,14,Fthe proposed two trillion euro
OL,15,Fspending plan.
OL,17,FThe meeting comes days after the
OL,18,Fterror attack at the Berlin Pride
OL,19,Ffestival that killed one person and
OL,20,Finjured at least 29 others.
OL,26,@nD@JOUoD@KO]
