OL,3,CMartin and Merz to hold talks in Dublin
OL,5,FThe attacker drove a van into a crowd
OL,6,Fof people, killing one person, before
OL,7,Fhe stabbed others with a machete.
OL,9,FThe suspect, named as Abdul Ballout,
OL,10,Fwas shot dead by police on Sunday
OL,11,Fafter being on the run for nearly 24
OL,12,Fhours. Ballout had reported links to
OL,13,Fthe so-called Islamic State group.
OL,15,FAhead of Tuesday's meeting with Mr
OL,16,FMerz, the Taoiseach said: "I will
OL,17,Fexpress the solidarity of the Irish
OL,18,Fpeople with the victims of the
OL,19,Fhorrific attack on the Pride parade in
OL,20,FBerlin at the weekend.
OL,26,@xD@[OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785212281
OL,3,CMartin and Merz to hold talks in Dublin
OL,5,F"The European Union is a community of
OL,6,Fvalues, chief among them respect for
OL,7,Fhuman dignity and equality and the
OL,8,Frights of minorities. What happened in
OL,9,FBerlin goes against everything that we
OL,10,Fstand for and we must never accept,
OL,11,Fnormalise or tolerate it.
OL,13,F"The European Union has a full and
OL,14,Fbusy agenda ahead of it in the coming
OL,15,Fmonths, and I look forward to
OL,16,Fdiscussing some of the biggest
OL,17,Fchallenges with the chancellor.
OL,26,@mD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785212281
OL,3,CMartin and Merz to hold talks in Dublin
OL,5,F"We need negotiations on the European
OL,6,FUnion's next long-term budget to reach
OL,7,Fagreement as soon as possible. I will
OL,8,Fbe listening carefully to the
OL,9,Fchancellor's position and discussing
OL,10,Fwith him how we can reach the
OL,11,Fnecessary compromises.
OL,13,F"We will also discuss strengthening
OL,14,FEurope's competitiveness, including
OL,15,Fthe work the Irish presidency is doing
OL,16,Fto simplify rules, deepen the single
OL,17,Fmarket, widen trading links, address
OL,18,Fenergy costs and make sure we are
OL,19,Fready for the climate and digital
OL,20,Ftransitions.
OL,26,@mD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
